{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20263y25sfQtxh1795390389.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>本月初宣布延遲上市的微億智創，今日起重新招股，入場費約1,584元。</p><p></p><p>每股招股價介乎10.87至15.69元，較原先招股價16.63至21.46元，下限價調低三成四，上限價調低近兩成七。發售股數維持逾3,727萬股H股，當中一成本港發售，餘額國際發售。</p><p></p><p>集資額由之前最多約8億元，降至最多逾5.84億元。下周二截止招股，下周五掛牌。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T00:43:25.601499+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":166,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T23:20:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T14:29:06.798955+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T00:37:14.575358+00:00","content_hash":"0d25e48a5853b66059ecaf921bc87e8700b90ca569ecd7d2d3b65aba8abea809","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-23T00:43:25.601499+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}